import NeighborhoodPage from "../layouts/NeighborhoodPage.astro";
---

<NeighborhoodPage
  title="Dentist Near Little Neck, NY | Thrive Dental"
  description="Dentist near Little Neck, NY? Thrive Dental is two LIRR stops west in Bayside. Implants, Invisalign, family and emergency care, free parking."
  neighborhood="Little Neck"
  distanceNote="two LIRR stops west, at the Bayside station on Bell Blvd"
  blurb="Little Neck sits at the eastern edge of Queens, and Thrive Dental is two stations west on the same Port Washington line. We're a full-service practice — preventive care, implants, Invisalign and emergencies — with free parking and weekend hours."
  whyIntro="We're two stops west of Little Neck station, or a straight run along Northern Boulevard. Patients here tend to compare us against practices over the Nassau line; what usually decides it is that everything happens in one office, from the scan to the crown."
  servicesIntro="One practice, three dentists, and the full range of treatment — so a routine cleaning and a full-mouth plan can live in the same chart."
  travelNote="Northern Boulevard connects Little Neck to Bell Boulevard directly, and Little Neck Parkway down to the Long Island Expressway works if you're heading in from the southern blocks. By rail we're two stations west on the Port Washington Branch. Parking at the office is free."
  landmarks={[
    "Two LIRR stops west of Little Neck station",
    "Direct via Northern Blvd; Marathon Pkwy and the Cross Island nearby",
    "Free on-site parking — no meters",
  ]}
  serviceLinks={[
    { href: "/services/emergency-dentistry", label: "Emergency Dentistry" },
    { href: "/services/dental-implants", label: "Dental Implants" },
    { href: "/services/invisalign", label: "Invisalign®" },
    { href: "/services/cosmetic-dentistry", label: "Cosmetic Dentistry" },
    { href: "/services/porcelain-veneers", label: "Porcelain Veneers" },
    { href: "/services/teeth-whitening", label: "Teeth Whitening" },
  ]}
>
  <section slot="after-hero" class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="container-slim max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="display-2 mb-5">Staying in Queens for your dental care</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Living this close to the Nassau County line means half the options in a search result are in Great Neck or beyond. There's nothing wrong with crossing the border, but it usually means a different insurance network, a different set of copays, and a drive that gets long the moment Northern Boulevard or the Long Island Expressway backs up. Staying on the Queens side keeps things simpler: we're in-network with most major PPO plans and we verify your benefits before treatment begins, so the number you're quoted is the number you pay.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        Geographically we're the closest thing to a neighborhood practice without being on your block — Northern Boulevard runs the whole way, Marathon Parkway and the Cross Island Parkway feed into it, and the railroad covers the trip in two stops if you'd rather not drive at all.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section slot="before-map" class="bg-sand-50 py-16 border-t border-brand-100/50">
    <div class="container-slim max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-gold-700 mb-4">How We Work</p>
      <h2 class="display-2 mb-5">Digital planning, in-house treatment</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Impressions here are taken with an iTero scanner rather than a tray of putty, which makes crowns, nightguards and aligner cases faster to plan and easier to sit through. For implants we use 3D cone beam imaging to map bone and nerve position before anything is placed. Thrive Dental is an Invisalign Platinum Provider, so aligner cases — including the complicated ones — are handled here rather than referred out.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        Our three dentists — Dr. Mikhaylova, Dr. Hart and Dr. Saleh — all trained at NYU and cover general, cosmetic and restorative care between them. If your treatment needs more than one set of hands, the consult happens in the same building on the same day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</NeighborhoodPage>
